23:40.010 --> 23:41.720
That's that, right there.

23:41.720 --> 23:45.340
And this concave downwards,
right here-- sorry, I meant

23:45.340 --> 23:48.440
to do it in the red color--
this concave downwards right

23:48.440 --> 23:51.440
here, is this, right there.

23:51.440 --> 23:54.490
And then the concave upwards
